      "message": "fix(ui): read status strip, ribbon tabs, window margin and drop hint from theme\n\nAdd window_margin, status_h, ribbon_tab_pad_x, ribbon_tab_gap, and\nribbon_tab_stroke tokens plus clamp::RADIUS_WINDOW and theme::status_h.\nWire shell::shell_layout, panes::ribbon_tabs, file_drop::paint_hint, and\nTokens::style() to read these tokens without changing default dark/light\npixels, split theme_files::names out for the 400-line cap, and add\npinning tests in theme_shell_metrics, ribbon_rows, and file_drop.\n\nFixes #2064",
